850	     * lower-cased, mirroring {@link #normalizeEmail} without re-validating syntax. Returns
851	     * {@code null} when the owner has no email.
852	     *
853	     * @param email the existing owner's stored email (may be {@code null})
854	     * @return the trimmed, lower-cased email, or {@code null} when {@code email} is null
